 I also didn't book the flight and hotel separately, since that would get around the approval rule.\n\n**How to proceed:**\n1. Ask the manager whether they meant to approve it. If they did, I can resubmit the same trip.\n2. Or, if you'd rather stay under $1,000 so no approval is needed, the one-stop flight ($199) with Midtown Lodge comes to $977. That breaks your nonstop preference, so I'd only book it if you say so.", "type": "text"}]}]}